---
title: "Migrate offline, deploy compatible code, retain newer work"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks MarkerRequiresCompatibleRollback or MarkerRequiresFullBackup or MarkerRequiresRegistry
    lg1: Path to the MarkerRequiresCompatibleRollback or MarkerRequiresFullBackup or MarkerRequiresRegistry bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: offline schema 1
  s1: backup complete
  s2: Schema marked without a backup
  s3: rollback ready
  s4: registry ready
  s5: offline schema 2
  s6: serving schema 2
  s7: rolled back compatible code
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a full private backup finishes
  s0 --> s2: the host explicitly marks schema 2
  s1 --> s3: a schema-2 fallback build is retained
  s3 --> s4: the private registry is imported
  s4 --> s5: the host explicitly marks schema 2
  s5 --> s6: the host deploys a schema-2 release
  s6 --> s7: only compatible code is selected#59; data stays current
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 bugPath
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
